  1343	    - [OD90](#od90) (item 40): `self` is an ordinary identifier with no special meaning. `Copy`
  1344	      stays reserved.
  1345	    - [Foundation question 9](#foundation-q9) (item 4): the trap names above.
  1346	    - [Review caps](#decided-2026-11-08-review-caps) (items 1, 2): the sign-off path and the cap
