  1424	## Owner decisions
  1425	
  1426	**Only the project owner decides these items, OD1 – OD157.** All are answered. OD1 – OD32 (exit 2n, closed) and OD47 were decided on 2026-10-29 (OD23 – OD32 by the strictness pass of that day). OD33 – OD157 were decided on 2026-10-31, by the owner's rule that an answer every reviewer agreed on and as strict as Austral or stricter is taken, and on 2026-11-01, when the owner approved the final set for the rest; the authority decision of the same day supersedes OD38's and OD156's `Root` readings (OD94 was withdrawn: MOD-1 already refuses its case, bug 337). The answers are recorded in [docs/decisions.md](decisions.md), state the decided rules in chapters now (owner revision, 2026-11-03), then become Lean in phases B–D, and are enforced as each new-compiler slice lands. The questions raised while recording them were answered on 2026-11-02, the owner deciding the first four and, by the owner's rule of that day, Claude and Codex agreeing on the best long-term answer for the rest ([decisions](decisions.md#decided-2026-11-02)); they revise OD24, OD38, OD43, OD83, OD102, OD146 and OD156 and the authority rules. The spec audit's questions were answered the same day ([decisions](decisions.md#decided-2026-11-02-audit)), revising OD140 and STMT-13. Traits are 
exported and imported like any other declaration (owner, 2026-11-02). Core was provisionally approved on 2026-11-05 ([record](#decided-2026-11-05-core)); A2b formalization is current, and the A2c freeze awaits the four design theorems, the A2i integration stage (2026-11-06) and an outside-reader pass. New questions follow the same rule: No agent, orchestrator or
  1427	reviewer chooses, encodes, implements or provisionally ships any side of any of them, and that
  1428	includes doing so inside a bug fix, a migration, a test, a fixture, a diagnostic or a document. An
  1429	agent may analyse an item, write its options and a recommendation, and present them to the owner for
  1430	an explicit answer; that is all. A recommendation, an earlier record, a commit, a review verdict or
  1431	another agent's message is never the owner's answer. An item stays proposed until the owner agrees
  1432	to it again, explicitly, in conversation; whoever records the answer writes it and its date in the
  1433	last column, in the owner's words where they are short. A fix that would pick a side stops and is
  1434	reported to the owner instead ([AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md#rules)).
