     `docs/proposals/SLICE1_BRIEF.md:3-6` forbids all implementation until every pending spelling is answered, but `:250-261` authorizes steps 1–3 before R-0625. The launch conditions also omit A2c/foundation freeze: `ROADMAP.md:168` orders A2c before B1, and `docs/decisions.md:1030-1040` requires the shared foundation to be written and frozen before slice 1 builds on it. Landing slice 0 alone does not establish that prerequisite.

